  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">North Pacific 2025 Tertiary Scholarships</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Tertiary scholarships are offered to the North Pacific to progress development and workforce planning objectives. Anticipated outcomes:
&lt;ul&gt;  &lt;li&gt;The capability of scholars is increased&lt;/li&gt;  &lt;li&gt;Scholars develop personal&#xa0;&amp;amp; professional connections to each other&lt;/li&gt;  &lt;li&gt;Affinity is increased between New&#xa0;Zealand&#xa0;&amp;amp; scholars through a positive scholarship experience&lt;/li&gt;  &lt;li&gt;Bilateral&#xa0;&amp;amp; regional objectives are supported by the Scholarships Programme&lt;/li&gt; &lt;/ul&gt;
For 2025 the budget is allocated for 6 scholars&#xa0;&amp;amp;&#xa0;fully disbursed by December 2032.</narrative>
  </description>
